      "examples": [
        {
          "exampleId": "w:baby#e-d3b3d1014ded2a19",
          "text": "Age is naturally a factor（因素） – only 58 percent of Generation Ys still use landlines now and then, compared to 84 percent of Baby Boomers who’ve perhaps had the same home number for 50 years.",
