        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:baby#e-3c884d45d02f0738",
          "text": "That said, to be honest the only people who ever ring our home phone are our Baby Boomer parents, to the point where we play a game and guess who is calling before we pick up the phone (using Caller ID would take the fun out of it).",
